  "slug": "nonconformance-corrective-action-request-form",
  "title": "Nonconformance Corrective Action Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Define the nonconformance problem with evidence, contain the affected scope, test causes, control implementation, verify effectiveness, and approve closure.",
  "description": "A root-cause and recurrence-prevention request specific to nonconforming product or process control that connects the requirement and observed evidence to containment, cause tests, cause-matched actions, effectiveness data, escalation, and accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when a problem involving a suspect product, material, or process output needs action beyond immediate correction and the organization must demonstrate that verified causes were addressed and sustained effectiveness was reviewed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
