          "key": "effectiveness_checks",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Effectiveness conclusion checks",
          "items": [
            "Success criteria were established before results were evaluated",
            "Evidence covers the defined population, sample, and review period",
            "No recurrence appears in the originating process",
            "Similar-risk areas were checked for occurrence elsewhere",
            "Actions did not create an adverse quality, delivery, or control effect",
